  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Timor-Leste Human Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia Timor-Leste Partnership for Human Development (PHD) is a 10-year program funded by the Government of Australia and implemented by Abt Global. 
The partnership is dedicated to improving the wellbeing of Timor-Leste&#x2019;s people and increasing their ability to contribute to the nation&#x2019;s development. PHD focuses on strengthening government systems. This supports Timor-Leste to deliver higher-quality primary healthcare and basic education and to advance disability inclusion 
and gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
