    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">With Australia&#x2019;s support the Timor-Leste Ministry of Health (MoH) conducted baseline assessments in three municipalities; these were used by municipal and regional health service providers to develop budgeted workplans. These workplans combine a number of previous plans into one and enable each municipality to have a single plan which combines funds from MOH and Ministry of State Administration (supporting decentralised services) and be used to efficiently allocate development partner funds. This work forms a key part of government health system reform and gives health facility staff the opportunity to participate in the planning and budgeting process.</narrative>
    </description>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-07-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-06-30"></period-end>
    </period>
   </indicator>
